## Make it yours

- Edit the agent's `instructions` in `src/index.ts` — the function form
  (`instructions: (ctx) => ...`) lets you inject per-user context.
- Add tools with `defineTool` — anything your systems can do, the agent can do.
- Add `bot.command()` / `bot.hears()` routes for deterministic replies that
  skip the LLM entirely (a `/reset` command is included).
- Middleware via `bot.use()` handles cross-cutting concerns; `rateLimit()` from
  `@wappa/core` is a ready-made one.
- Conversation history lives as JSON files under `./sessions` — delete a file
  (or send `/reset` in chat) to start a conversation over.
- Unit-test your bot without WhatsApp or an LLM key using `MockTransport` and
  `ScriptedProvider` from `@wappa/core/testing`.
